Big condolences.  It hurts to die so late in a well-going game.  But
there are ways to die at any stage of the game.

A suggestion, if you want it, always know your way out.  Even when
just strolling through the dungeon have your inventory set up to get
you out of a situation (e.g. a lizard corpse and a scroll of teleport
in main inventory and be prepared to use them), and furthermore during
risky times like dragging chests while stressed or cavorting around in
the nude, be it for dancing or swimming, know how you're going to
escape.  Then furthermore recognize in your mind when you're about to
do something fraught with peril and be prepared to play slowly.

Better skill next time,
